WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.530 --> 00:00:13.060
Every time it destroys a monster, 
it gains 400 attack points!

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.990
It keeps getting stronger!

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:19.320
The Dark Signers won't be defeated easily.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.000
I'm certain that our battles will be tough.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:27.820
But that's when you should 
remember each of your friends!

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:32.040
Even when we're apart, we're 
connected by a strong bond!

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.560
Everyone, let's win so 
that we can meet again!

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:39.920
Give it your all!

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:00.690
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:05.790
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:10.700
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:15.470
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:20.830
No matter how bad today is

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:25.820
There's still the faintest light

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.220
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:35.280
Is light it myself

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:40.290
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:45.260
Even if I get countless scars

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:51.560
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:01:51.870 --> 00:01:55.540
Today will never exist again

00:01:55.870 --> 00:02:01.440
So I won't stop or vanish

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:30.410
Minus WorldFind Regulus the White Lion

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:45.770
It's your turn, kid.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:49.260
Lua…

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:52.570
Lua won't be able to survive that damage!

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.730
What can we do?

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:56.410
What's wrong?  Aren't you going to draw?

00:02:56.410 --> 00:03:02.320
If you surrender instead, 
you'll die painlessly.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.680
Whatever!

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.820
I promised to protect Luca!

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.740
My turn!  I draw!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.610
Think!

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:17.210
Due to Magician Ape's effect, if I summon 
a monster, he gains control of it.

00:03:17.210 --> 00:03:18.310
In that case…

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.680
I summon Morphtronic Magnen 
Bar in defense position!

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.420
I set one card and end my turn.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.090
So there's nothing you can do.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.560
I promise to defeat him, Luca!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.460
Like I thought, this is the spirit world.

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:42.390
I have to hurry and rescue Ancient 
Fairy Dragon and return to my world.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:43.800
Lua is in danger!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:49.410
My servant named Regulus will come meet you.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:54.040
Combine your powers and free me.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:58.250
Ancient Fairy Dragon, did you bring me here?

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:03.040
If I don't free you, we can't 
defeat the Earthbound Immortals.

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.720
There's a city over there!

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:12.200
Let's go, Kuribon!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.340
Is anyone here?

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.820
Huh?

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.930
What are you all doing?

00:04:29.450 --> 00:04:31.320
Wait a second!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.480
What's going on?

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.720
You over there…

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.680
Please don't run away!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.870
Why is everyone running away?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.010
What's wrong, Kuribon?

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:13.100
The ball bounced up the stairs.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.730
What's going on?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.520
Look.  The leaves are 
reattaching to the branch.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.830
Do events happen backwards in this world?

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.260
What is this?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.280
I've seen it around.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.290
What?

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.280
They're coming!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.570
They're coming to capture spirits!

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.190
Hurry up and flee!

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.190
What do you mean?

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:48.060
Oh no!

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.310
This way, Kuribon!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:58.010
I smell them!  I smell spirits!

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.440
Where are the spirits?

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:03.200
You go that way.  I'll search up ahead.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:07.390
Search over here!  I'm going this way!

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:08.900
Who are they?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.260
The card spirits...

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:21.140
Don't be scared.

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:30.670
Found them!

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.530
No!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:57.600
How does it fell to be minus?

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:02.070
What should I do?  Kuribon 
and the others are…

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.030
She's over there!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.190
Catch her!

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.770
Cut her off!  Trap her from both sides!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.860
A dead end!  What should I do?

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.710
My turn.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.110
I activate Magician Ape's effect.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:47.810
By sending one card in my hand to the 
graveyard, I gain control of one of your monsters.

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.870
Cursed Needle!

00:07:57.860 --> 00:07:59.590
Oh no!

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:02.020
He took Lua's monster again!

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:02.830
You're wrong.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:05.040
You fell for it!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.550
When Magnen Bar is in defense position

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:10.550
on your side of the field, 
your monsters can't battle!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.440
Well done!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.140
Then I'll get rid of this obstacle.

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:20.490
I release Magnen Bar to 
Tribute Summon Fighter Ape!

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:27.690
1900 attack points?

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:31.790
Fighter Ape attacks you directly!

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:35.510
Stop!

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.740
I activate my trap!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.280
Remake Puzzle!

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:44.540
By destroying a Morphtronic monster 
on the field, the Battle Phase ends.

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:48.620
Then I can Special Summon one 
Morphtronic monster from my graveyard

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:51.020
whose Level is lower than 
Morphtronic Magnen's.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:53.010
Come, Morphtronic Magnen Bar!

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:04.360
You avoided pain this time, but 
I wonder how long you'll last.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.360
I end my turn!

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:10.600
Luca, I'll give it my all!

00:09:15.890 --> 00:09:17.810
The monkey geoglyph…

00:09:17.810 --> 00:09:21.310
There's a duel against a Dark Signer, but...

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.320
There's no response from my mark.

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:31.660
That means a Signer isn't battling him?

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:34.240
Where did she go?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.500
Search more!

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.670
This way!

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:47.960
They left.

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:51.010
Thank you.  You saved me.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:56.940
Little girl, you came from a different world?

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:02.950
Sheesh, why would a child wander 
into the spirit world all alone?

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:05.990
If I wasn't here, who knows 
what would've happened to you.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:09.900
This isn't how you talk 
to someone older than you!

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.820
You're still a child too.

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:13.360
I'm not a child.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:16.100
Even though I look like 
this, I'm a senior citizen.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:19.060
My name is Torunka.

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.940
Nice to meet you, little girl.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:35.170
You're all Spellcaster spirits?

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:39.350
That's right.  They've captured 
all the other spirits.

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:46.820
We managed to escape, but the minus 
curse turned us into children.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.830
Minus curse?

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:54.270
Yes.  Minus energy is so powerful 
that it can turn back time.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:56.830
What do you mean?  Tell me in detail.

00:10:58.240 --> 00:11:02.430
Spirits used to live peacefully 
together in this world.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:11.240
Everyone used their unique abilities to help 
each other, so we had a peaceful and rich life.

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:19.890
But everything changed when those 
hunters came to Shubank City.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:24.210
They're trying to change everything 
in the world into minus.

00:11:25.560 --> 00:11:34.340
If the Cursed Needle is set to minus, it 
unleashes a minus curse that traps spirits.

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:36.040
Cursed Needle?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:40.380
Do you know a spirit named Regulus?

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:42.080
Regulus?

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:44.660
How do you know Master Regulus?

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:49.350
I came to this world in order 
to rescue Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:52.590
Are you a Signer?

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:54.590
Does that mean you know?

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:58.600
Where can I find Regulus?  Please tell me!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.350
No.  It's too dangerous 
to meet him right now.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:03.570
Dangerous?

00:12:03.960 --> 00:12:07.570
Master Regulus has been 
acting strange lately.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:11.830
He shows his fangs at 
anyone who approaches him.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:21.020
Master Regulus is agitated because he 
couldn't protect Ancient Fairy Dragon.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:27.030
But I can't rescue Ancient 
Fairy Dragon without Regulus!

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:30.930
We also need to rescue Kuribon 
and the other captured spirits!

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:34.330
Please tell me where I can find Regulus!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:38.140
He's hiding in Poyaru Forest.

00:12:38.140 --> 00:12:39.670
Poyaru Forest.

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:42.040
Torunka, guide me there!

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.940
That's crazy!  If we leave right 
now, we're going to get captured!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.920
Torunka, hurry!

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.910
Stop being cruel to the elderly!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.120
There they are!

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.820
They found us!

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:01.590
I told you so!

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:03.560
Stop!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.020
Wait!

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.750
Luca, this isn't the time to play!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.690
Now's our chance.  Hurry!

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:46.440
They're not chasing us anymore.

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.340
I can't walk any further.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:53.360
Sheesh, you should try 
harder since you're a boy.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.260
I told you that I'm old!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:59.340
I won't walk one step further!

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.770
Oh well.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:04.320
C'mon.

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:07.560
Hurry up and get on.  I'll carry you.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.530
Thanks.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.980
Poyaru Forest is that way, right?

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:19.800
Luca, you're a strong child.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.570
Me?  I'm not strong.

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.910
When I was young, I was always sick.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.510
Really?

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:31.730
But I sense heroic power from you, Luca.

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:34.030
That's not me.

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:38.840
It's the power of a certain individual 
who's protecting me from afar.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.650
Are you talking about Ancient Fairy Dragon?

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:43.910
No...

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:48.820
It's a person who's always by my side.

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:51.430
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:52.570 --> 00:14:57.190
It's here!  I summon Morphtronic 
Celfon in attack position!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:10.990
Dial on!

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:14.820
When Celfon is in attack position, 
it dials a number between 1 and 6,

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:17.520
and I look at that many cards 
from the top of my deck.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:22.060
If there's a Level 4-or-below Morphtronic 
monster, I can Special Summon it!

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.510
Three cards!

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:28.760
I have one!

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:32.380
I Special Summon Morphtronic Remoten!

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.880
A Tuner Monster, I see.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:43.900
Then I activate the spell card 
Level Mirroring from my hand!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:50.320
Magnen Bar's Level becomes the 
same as your Magician Ape!

00:15:54.320 --> 00:16:00.100
Level 3 Remoten tunes the now Level 
3 Magnen Bar and Level 1 Celfon!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:10.520
In order to protect world peace, 
courage and power dock together!

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:12.890
Synchro Summon!

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:16.470
The emissary of love and 
justice!  Power Tool Dragon!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:23.810
All right!  Lua brought out a 
Synchro Monster before he did!

00:16:24.850 --> 00:16:29.530
He's properly analyzing his opponent's field 
while he duels.  Your skills have improved, Lua.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.500
A toy dragon?

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:37.880
Since you're not a Signer, that 
monster is appropriate for a phony.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.510
Don't make fun of me!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.910
Due to Power Tool Dragon's effect,

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:46.250
I can add one random Equip Spell in 
my deck to my hand once per turn!

00:16:47.570 --> 00:16:51.250
I equip the Equip Spell Break! 
Draw! on to Power Tool Dragon!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:59.180
When the equipped monster destroys your 
monster in battle, I get to draw one card.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:03.670
After I use this effect three 
times, this card is destroyed.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:06.010
Power Tool Dragon, start the counterattack!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.670
Attack Magician Ape!

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.260
Crafty Break!

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:18.470
Since Power Tool Dragon 
destroyed your monster,

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:21.470
due to Break! Draw!'s 
effect, I draw one card.

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.230
I end my turn!

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:24.770
How's that?

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.070
Stop underestimating me 
because I'm not a Signer!

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:31.430
I have Power Tool Dragon, 
the most powerful dragon!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.470
Hey, Torunka.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:38.780
What is it?

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:41.960
Where do they take the captured spirits?

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:47.720
After they're turned into minus, they're 
taken to Zeman the Ape King's castle.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.860
Zeman the Ape King?

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.450
Is that their leader?

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:53.600
Yes.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:18:00.460
No one knows where he came 
from or what his true goal is.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.710
Zeman the Ape King…

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:13.020
Ancient Fairy Dragon, your sealed power 
will become minus and belong to me.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:27.780
I need Regulus to completely turn 
Ancient Fairy Dragon into minus.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.480
What's so funny?

00:18:38.480 --> 00:18:40.590
That's the spirit.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:49.410
It would be rude to the gods if this minor 
battle of destiny wasn't entertaining.

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:54.380
What do you mean by minor battle?  
I'm risking my life in this battle!

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:58.880
We offer this duel to the great gods!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.070
My turn!

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:03.850
I summon Dark Tuner Dark 
Ape in attack position!

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.250
Dark Tuner?

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.930
Be careful, Lua!

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:17.200
Then I activate the spell 
card Dark Wave from my hand!

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:23.050
Fighter Ape's Level becomes its 
Level multiplied by negative 1.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:30.100
Level 2 Dark Ape dark tunes 
Level negative 5 Fighter Ape!

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:49.300
Born from darkness, become the 
ruler of the negative world!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.790
Dark Synchro!

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:55.220
Appear, Zeman the Ape King!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:04.200
When Zeman the Ape King 
attacks, you can't activate

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:08.000
spell or trap cards until 
the end of the Damage Step.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.860
I don't care if it's a Dark Synchro monster!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:15.330
I'm not scared!  I have Power 
Tool Dragon on my side!

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:20.020
Lua, that's the spirit!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:22.440
You have more life points than him!

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:28.770
Since Dark Ape was used to Dark Synchro, 
I get to draw one card from my deck.

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:36.750
I activate the Field Spell Closed Forest!

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.210
Field Spell?

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:39.690
This is bad!

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:44.190
If the Field Spell activates, he has 
everything he needs to summon an Earthbound Immortal!

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:55.870
This is Poyaru Forest?

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:57.870
The fog is getting thick.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:05.090
Many things are also moving backwards here.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.510
Be careful, Luca.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:12.830
As I said before, Master Regulus 
has lost his composure.

00:21:13.090 --> 00:21:14.440
Regulus!

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:16.640
Come out!  I need to talk to you!

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:19.790
Shh!  What if he attacks us?

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:23.000
It's fine.  If we talk, he'll understand.

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:25.230
Regulus, please!

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:27.470
We're not enemies!

00:21:31.530 --> 00:21:32.750
Regulus?

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:43.900
Master Regulus…

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:46.510
He's Regulus?

00:21:56.940 --> 00:22:01.410
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:06.480
We will build our own future

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:11.920
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:17.090
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:32.230
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:37.800
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:42.510
Even if it loses its light

00:22:42.980 --> 00:22:47.780
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:47.780 --> 00:22:52.250
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:57.830
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:57.960 --> 00:23:02.640
This journey has no end

00:23:02.930 --> 00:23:08.170
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:13.410
